@startuml session-chat-client-sequence
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
participant "ChatClient" as Client
participant "SessionTurnAdvisor\n(outside the loop)" as Turn
participant "ToolCallingAdvisor" as Loop
participant "SessionMemoryAdvisor\n(inside the loop)" as Memory
participant SessionService as Svc
participant ChatModel as Model

Client -> Turn: adviseCall(request)
Turn -> Svc: findById / create (first use)
Turn -> Loop: nextCall(request)
loop every round, until a reply without tool calls
  Loop -> Memory: before(request)
  Memory -> Svc: getEvents(id, active view)
  Memory -> Memory: the prompt: system messages first,\nthe history the round does not carry, the request
  Memory -> Svc: appendEvent(user message | tool results)
  Memory -> Model: call(prompt)
  Model --> Memory: reply
  Memory -> Svc: appendEvent(reply)
  Memory --> Loop: after(response)
  Loop -> Loop: run the tool calls, if any
end
Loop --> Turn: the final response
opt the loop ended without a model round\n(returnDirect, breached tool call limit)
  Turn -> Svc: appendEvent(the tool results)
end
opt the compaction trigger fires
  Turn -> Svc: compact(id, trigger, strategy)
  note right: now, or after the reply\nwith asyncCompaction
end
Turn --> Client: the response
@enduml
